<section id="about" class="section-service" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-about;"><!--[--><div class="service-about u-bg-primary hygiene-page__about"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block"><div class="scroll-block__overlay"></div><div class="scroll-block__content scroll-block-grid"><div class="scroll-block-grid__header"><div class="scroll-block-progress"><div class="scroll-block-progress__fill"></div></div><h2 class="scroll-block__title u-text-headings-medium">Pie higiēnista ieteicams doties divas reizes gadā, it īpaši, ja</h2></div><div class="scroll-block-grid__body"><div class="scroll-block__items"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Vēlies uzlabot zobu toni</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Pēc profesionālās higiēnas zobi kļūst par pustoni vai pat toni gaišāki</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Vēlies saglabāt zobu veselību</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Laba mutes dobuma higiēna + profesionāla higiēnista apmeklējums ir labākā profilakse.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Asiņo vai sāp smaganas</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Higiēnists ir pirmais speciālists, pie kā vērsties.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Slikta elpa</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Ir slikta elpa un vēlies to novērst. Pēc higiēnista apmeklējuma iegūsisvaiguma sajūtu.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Vēlies uzlabot imunitāti</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Mutes dobumā ir daudz baktēriju, kas spēj ietekmēt kopējo veselību, īpaši zarnu traktu.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Neregulāra zobu tīrīšana</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Higiēnists iztīra arī visgrūtāk sasniedzamās vietas un rūpējas par to, ka tīrs ir ne tikai katrs zobs, bet arī viss mutes dobums.</div></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-price u-bg-primary hygiene-page__price"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-price__title">Profesionāla zobu un mutes dobuma higiēna šobrīd</h2><p class="u-text-body-medium">BONUSĀ saņem bezmaksas konsultāciju par profesionālu zobu balināšanu (40 € vērtībā)</p><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="service-price__prices"><!----><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--new u-text-headings-medium">110 €</span></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Pieteikties vizītei<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="reveal-block service-apply u-bg-primary service-apply--layout-alternate hygiene-page__apply"><div class="reveal-block__content"><div class="reveal-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><p class="reveal-block__title u-text-headings-large"><span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">Izbaudi</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">jaunākās</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">paaudzes</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">higiēnas</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">aparāta</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">priekšrocības</span><span class="sr-only" style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0px; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0px, 0px, 0px, 0px); white-space: nowrap; border: 0px;">Izbaudi jaunākās paaudzes higiēnas aparāta priekšrocības</span></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="reveal-block__body u-bg-secondary" style="background-color:#031C14;"><div class="reveal-block__bg"><canvas class="lava-bg-illustration reveal-block__bg-illustration" width="1920" height="1230"></canvas><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><p class="reveal-block__title reveal-block__title--bg u-text-headings-large">Izbaudi jaunākās paaudzes higiēnas aparāta priekšrocības</p><!--]--></div></div><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="reveal-block__main-wrap"><div class="reveal-block__main"><!--[--><div class="service-apply-grid"><div class="service-apply-grid__item service-apply-box u-bg-secondary"><div class="service-apply-box__aside"><div class="video-dialog video-dialog--type-cover service-apply-box__preview"><video class="video-dialog__preview" width="300" height="534" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" src="/cms/api/media/file/hygiene-apply-tease.webm" autoplay=""></video><button aria-label="Play video" class="video-dialog__button"><div class="icon-button icon-button--type-primary icon-button--size-medium video-dialog__play-button"><div class="icon-button__icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 54 54"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22.031 19.687a1 1 0 0 1 1.515-.858l12.188 7.313a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.715L23.546 35.17a1 1 0 0 1-1.515-.857V19.687Z"></path></svg><!--]--></div></div></button><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></div></div><div class="service-apply-box__body"><p class="u-text-headings-small">Izbaudi jaunākās paaudzes higiēnas aparāta priekšrocības</p><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end service-apply-box__cta-button"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Pieteikties vizītei<!--]--></div><!----></button></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="reveal-block__timeline"><div class="reveal-block__timeline-item reveal-block__timeline-item--intro"></div><div class="reveal-block__timeline-item reveal-block__timeline-item--main"></div></div></div><div class="service-when u-bg-primary hygiene-page__when"><div class="list-block list-block--visible"><div class="list-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="list-block__title u-text-headings-large">Kāpēc veikt higiēnu LAVA dental studio?</h2><div class="list-block__header-photos"><!--[--><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/aa9bb355e2fb-5.avif 1x, /assets/img/3c9508ddad64-5.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0s;" src="/assets/img/aa9bb355e2fb-5.avif"><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/8609c9733850-6.avif 1x, /assets/img/034344ae5b62-6.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0.2s;" src="/assets/img/8609c9733850-6.avif"><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="list-block__body u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><ul class="list-block__items"><!--[--><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">01</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Atmosfēra</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Noskaņa, kādu neatradīsi nevienā citā zobārstniecības klīnikā Latvijā. Mūsu studijas interjers veidots tā, lai klienti varētu relaksēties un aizmirst par stresu un bailēm, kas bieži saistās ar zobārsta vai higiēnista apmeklējumu.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">02</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Procedūra, kas līdzinās spa apmeklējumam</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Mēs zobu higiēnu pielīdzinām spa procedūrai, kas maigi rūpējas par Taviem zobiem un smaganām, padarot tos tīrākus un gaišākus, vienlaikus samazinot saslimšanu risku.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.8s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">03</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Netflix higiēnista krēslā</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Jā, pie mums katram klientam ir iespēja relaksēties un skatīties savu iemīļoto seriālu vai klausīties iecienītāko mūziku, kamēr higiēnists veic savu darbu.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:1s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">04</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Jaunākās tehnoloģijas un augsti kvalificēti speciālisti</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Savā darbā izmantojam jaunākās tehnoloģijas, un mūsu higiēnisti ir patiesi sava darba entuziasti.</div></div></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="service-efficiency u-bg-secondary hygiene-page__efficiency"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-efficiency__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Zobu veselības atslēga<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-efficiency__body"><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/96d2d8954a7d-3.avif 1x, /assets/img/21f24660c1ce-3.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded image-info-box__image image-info-box__image--visible" alt="Service Efficiency" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/96d2d8954a7d-3.avif"><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">Regulāra zobu higiēna un higiēnista apmeklējums vismaz divas reizes gadā.</p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Diemžēl 2021. gadā veiktajā pētījumā tika konstatēts, ka 41% Latvijas iedzīvotāju nekad nav apmeklējuši higiēnistu un 74% to nav darījuši pēdējā gada laikā, jo uzskata to par luksusa procedūru.</p>
<p>Mēs vēlamies normalizēt higiēnista apmeklējumu, jo tā ir pilnīga nepieciešamība katram! Uzskatām, ka labāk ieguldīt nelielus līdzekļus profilaksē, nevis lielus — sarežģītā ārstēšanā.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--footer"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Pieteikties vizītei<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-how u-bg-primary hygiene-page__how"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-how-grid"><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Kā tas notiek?<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--body"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-secondary service-how__progress"></div><div class="service-how__items"><!--[--><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/ddf03bc99865-7.avif 1x, /assets/img/1e719489cea9-7.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/ddf03bc99865-7.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>1. Higiēnists izzina Tavu pieredzi un ieradumus</h3>
<p>Higiēnists noskaidros Tavu iepriekšējo pieredzi unprecizēs Tavu mutes higiēnas rutīnu.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/3cac3f36a3bf-8.avif 1x, /assets/img/37472141db8f-8.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/3cac3f36a3bf-8.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>2. Veiks tieši Tev pielāgotu procedūru</h3>
<p>Klīnikā visi higiēnisti strādā ar Šveicē ražotu jaunākās paaudzes aparātu — EMS AIRFLOW MASTER. Tā ir ierīce, kas automātiski pielāgo spiedienu un ultraskaņas intensitāti un izmanto īpaši saudzīgu glicīna pulveri, lai maksimāli efektīvi un bezsāpīgi noņemtu aplikumu, pigmentu un zobakmeni.</p>
<p>Šī tehnoloģija nodrošina, ka netiek bojāta zobu emalja un mīkstie audi, kā tas var notikt, izmantojot standarta higiēnas metodes, kur rezultāts bieži vien ir atkarīgs no speciālista profesionalitātes un pieredzes.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/83f3aa291624-9.avif 1x, /assets/img/44a15da5321e-9.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/83f3aa291624-9.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>3. Netflix &amp; Chill</h3>
<p>Kamēr higiēnists veic savu darbu, Tu vari baudītmūziku vai iemīļotāko Netflix raidījumu, skatoties TV, kas piestiprināts pie griestiem.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/2533527e1918-10.avif 1x, /assets/img/f297d25751aa-10.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/2533527e1918-10.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>4. Zobu palutināšana ar fluora gelu</h3>
<p>Procedūras noslēgumā tiek uzklāts fluora gels ar 5000 ppm fluorīda koncentrāciju, kas stiprina zobus, nodrošina papildu aizsardzību un neitralizē skābes mutes dobumā.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/977e7c5f988a-11.avif 1x, /assets/img/5ac5bce986ea-11.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/977e7c5f988a-11.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>5. Zobu kopšanas rekomendācijas</h3>
<p>Individuāli piemeklēsim un ieteiksim Tev zobu birsti, zobu pastu, zobu diegu un mutes skalojamo līdzekli.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/899532281dbc-12.avif 1x, /assets/img/7203c1404d3a-12.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/899532281dbc-12.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>6. Ja higiēnists konstatē zobu bojājumus</h3>
<p>Ja higiēnists konstatēs zobu bojājumus, viņš ieteiks apmeklēt zobārstu.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-price u-bg-primary hygiene-page__price"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-price__title">Profesionāla zobu un mutes dobuma higiēna šobrīd</h2><p class="u-text-body-medium">BONUSĀ saņem bezmaksas konsultāciju par profesionālu zobu balināšanu (40 € vērtībā)</p><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="service-price__prices"><!----><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--new u-text-headings-medium">110 €</span></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Pieteikties vizītei<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section>
